{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45096","headline":"新秋同卢侍御薛员外白苹洲月夜 · 皎然","name":"新秋同卢侍御薛员外白苹洲月夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隔暑苹洲近，迎凉欲泛舟。\n荣从宪府至，喜会夕郎游。\n气夺沧浪色，风欺汗漫流。\n谁言三伏夜，独此月前秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}